# This directory is //go:embed'd by server.go (as staticNextFS) and served
# under /next/. Its contents are generated by `npm run build` in the
# repository root's ui-ng/ (angular.json's outputPath) -- not checked in,
# for the same reasons ../static/.gitignore gives: a stale build can never
# ship in place of a real one, and placeholder.html is the one tracked
# non-dotfile that lets go:embed compile on a fresh checkout.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!placeholder.html
